        "name": "Min-Plus Matrix-Vector Product",
        "pseudocode": "TROP-MV(A, v):\n  for i = 0 to g-1:\n    result[i] = min over j of (A[i,j] + v[j])\n  return result\n\nComplexity: O(g\u00b2)",
