        "pseudocode": "Algorithm: ComputeProfile(x, C, obs, \u03b9)\n1. y \u2190 C(x)\n2. for each i \u2208 \u03b9: f[i] \u2190 obs[i](y)\n3. return f\nTime: O(|\u03b9| \u00b7 T_obs), Space: O(|\u03b9|)",
